      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looking at this patch again... Don\u0027t we have a race with the host\u0027s irq remapping code which may still modify DMAR_IQT_REG at any time (while we are initializing pKVM)?\n\n\nAnd not just here... e.g. in initialize_qi() we wait until pending invalidations are completed, but what if irq remapping submits _new_ invalidations in the meantime?",
      "revId": "70708fd66bc2a74ff1b3b5d01a9f2cff18dde5a4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "0c34addf_6bcdde86",
        "filename": "arch/x86/kvm/vmx/pkvm/hyp/iommu.c",
